{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["given: on the other hand","Since the night of \"given's\" first live performance, the relationship between Mafuyu Satou and Ritsuka Uenoyama has been smooth sailing. Their shared love of music reinforces their bond, and every moment spent together makes them more inseparable. Nevertheless, there will come times when they will suffer setbacks, with both of them consumed by their inner turmoil.\n\n\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"],"ja":["ギヴン うらがわの存在",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-49053","ids":{"shikimori":49053,"mal":49053,"anilist":134710,"kodik":"movie-87032"},"kodikIds":["movie-112899","movie-82485","movie-87032"],"kodikRevisions":{"movie-112899":"2025-08-23T05:05:44Z","movie-82485":"2022-01-04T09:48:22Z","movie-87032":"2022-06-14T08:45:09Z"},"title":"Дарованный OVA","originalTitle":"Given: Uragawa no Sonzai","alt":"ギヴン うらがわの存在 given: on the other hand ギヴン うらがわの存在","description":"С той ночи, когда группа «given» дала свой первый живой концерт, отношения Мафую Сато и Рицуки Уэноямы складываются как нельзя лучше. Общая любовь к музыке лишь крепче связывает их, и каждая минута, проведённая вместе, делает эту связь ещё прочнее. И всё же впереди их ждут трудные времена, когда обоих захлестнёт внутренняя буря переживаний.","year":2021,"type":"OVA","genres":["Драма","яой","Музыка","Школа"],"rating":8.13,"popularity":33133,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx134710-m3VYouLXKIYv.jpg","width":460,"height":654},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/27810fb32ffc217ec5ee9d151957038efe02e706.jpg","width":1280,"height":720}},"releasedEpisodes":[1],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-3736","dubId":"3736","label":"AniFlames","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef"